<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Dark Knight Weapons</h1>
<p>The weapon skills the Dark Knights' guild of Midgaard teaches. Level is the guild level at which you can first practice the weapon there, and Up to is the most you can learn it at the guild (see <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>). Each weapon has its own help: help and the weapon's name.
</p>
<pre>Name           Level   Up to
Dagger             0   80%
Fist               0   70%
Quarterstaff       0   100%
Hand Axe           1   100%
Rapier             1   100%
Short Sword        2   100%
Mace               3   100%
Long Sword         4   100%
Scimitar           4   100%
Club               5   100%
Spear              6   100%
Whip               9   100%
War Hammer        10   100%
Morning Star      14   100%
Flail             15   100%
Battle Club       16   100%
Battle Mace       18   100%
Lance             21   100%
Maul              24   100%
Great Sword       25   100%
Bardiche          26   100%
Halberd           28   100%
</pre>
